{
  "about": "Where unbrowse-core states each papers/params.toml value. Checked by `python3 -I papers/params_check.py`. code_value = params_v * scale. Text params use `nth`: the nth number in the text v. `implied` is the code value of a site with no literal (the pattern has no capture group). Every params key is in `mapped` or `unmapped`, never both; `open_in_code` annotates unmapped keys whose value core already fixes; `retired_in_code` lists parameters papers retired that code still defines (each site fails the check).",
